@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_LOCAL_TOKEN
@orgID = 1
@documentID = 1

# 先登录并在本机填写变量；不要把真实Token提交到仓库。
# orgID/documentID使用自己响应中的ID，不使用隔离样例清单ID。

### 上传原创 Markdown；REST Client 的相对文件路径相对于本文件
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=nexusdesk-week05-fixture

--nexusdesk-week05-fixture
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="01-onboarding.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../docs/knowledge/samples/01-onboarding.md
--nexusdesk-week05-fixture--

### 列表；可加 &status=READY
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 元数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 显式解析；无请求体，READY重复调用409
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### READY纯文本
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 授权原文件下载
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 上传者或admin软删除；之后详情/text/download均404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
